Licensed under the MIT License.

The format capability matrix in `src/markitdown_doctor/formats.py` was derived
by reading MarkItDown 0.1.8's converter modules and by running the real
converters in a clean virtual environment. It mirrors upstream's converter
registry; when upstream adds or changes converters, that file needs updating.

